        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the body’s defense system in this fast-paced action shooter. Step into the role of a powerful immune cell and use precise controls to target and eliminate waves of invading bacteria and viruses. Strategically choose your character, complete challenging levels, upgrade your abilities, and defend vital organs from infection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With intuitive gameplay, satisfying progression, and escalating challenges, the battle for survival begins at the cellular level.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● 3 Unique Playable Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● 3 Game Modes Story, Hardcore, and Endless</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●● Story Mode: A casual, easy-paced experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●● Hardcore Mode: For players seeking a real challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >●● Endless Mode: One Life, survive as long as you can</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● 5 Distinct Biomes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● 23+ Upgrades and Perks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● 5 Epic Boss Battles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >● Global Leaderboards— compete for the top spot</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
